            "fileLayoutStrategyId": "none",
            "text": {
                "initialization": "",
                "initializationLanguageId": "",
                "source": "fun emitCAndSourceMap(namedCAst, headers, cBackendService3, forwardDeclarations) {\n  val packet1 = pop(\"namedCAst\")\n  val packet2 = pop(\"headers\")\n  val packet3 = pop(\"forwardDeclarations\")\n  val outcome = cBackendService3.invokeEmitCAndSourceMap(packet1, packet2, packet3)\n  when (outcome) {\n    is Success -> {\n    push(\"sourceMap\", outcome.value)\n    }\n    is Failure -> {\n    return outcome\n    }\n  }\n}",
                "sourceLanguageId": "kotlin",
                "specification": "# emitCAndSourceMap\n\n## Functional role\n\nThis entity is a callable processing function in the lowerToCBackend composite. Its name is a verb because it performs the operation; it is not a prototype and does not own the bulk algorithm.\n\n## Technical contract\n\n- Function signature: `emitCAndSourceMap(namedCAst, headers, cBackendService3, forwardDeclarations)`.\n- Incoming links are noun-named channels materialized as function arguments: `namedCAst`, `headers`, `cBackendService3`, `forwardDeclarations`.\n- Data arguments hold packet or object-prototype instances. The function MUST pop each data channel before invoking the library.\n- Library argument: `cBackendService3`, supplied by the `library_cBackend` library suite.\n- The function invokes one coherent library operation `invokeEmitCAndSourceMap(...)` and routes its Operation<T,E> result.\n- Success packets are pushed to outgoing noun-named channels: `sourceMap`.\n- Expected failures are routed to the returned failure; failures MUST NOT be hidden.\n- Parsing, resolution, evaluation, lowering, emission, and workspace algorithms belong in the library suite, not in this node.",
                "specificationLanguageId": "markdown",
                "tests": "{\"cases\":[]}",
                "testsLanguageId": "json",
                "aiInstructions": "",
                "aiInstructionsLanguageId": "markdown"
            },
