                "sourceLanguageId": "kotlin",
                "specification": "# headers\n\n## Functional role\n\nThis link is a named data channel. It carries instances of the declared packet prototype from `buildCSubsetAstAndDependencies` to `emitCAndSourceMap`. The channel name is a noun because the link holds information or an object instance; processing verbs belong to the endpoint functions.\n\n## Technical contract\n\n- Channel name: `headers`; it is unique among all channels incident to either endpoint.\n- Source function: `buildCSubsetAstAndDependencies` pushes through source port `headers`.\n- Target function: `emitCAndSourceMap` receives the channel at target port `headers`.\n- Payload: instances of the declared packet prototype.\n- Transport: in-process.\n- The source pushes packets and the target pops packets; no hidden transformation occurs in the channel.\n- Any adaptation belongs in the explicitly invoked library operation, not in the link.\n- Declared prototype: `CSubsetAst`; the link carries instances of this type definition.",
