            "text": {
                "initialization": "",
                "initializationLanguageId": "",
                "source": "",
                "sourceLanguageId": "kotlin",
                "specification": "# runCompileTimeExpansion\n\n## Functional role\n\nThis composite is a callable function for one compiler phase boundary. It is not a prototype or a passive container.\n\n## Technical contract\n\n- Its child processing nodes and nested libraries implement one phase-level function.\n- Links crossing this composite are materialized as arguments to the callable function; they carry packets or library capabilities.\n- Child nodes pop input packets, invoke library functions, and push result packets. The composite owns sequencing and routing, not the bulk algorithms.\n- Child functions: `scheduleCpxExpansions`, `detectCompileTimeCycles`, `reflectTypes`, `buildSpecializationKey`, `stabilizeTypeUniverse`, `expandStructuralCpx`, `expandReflectiveCpx`, `loadOrCreateGenericSpecialization`, `library_compileTimeEvaluation`.\n- The layout is a relaxed left-to-right fiber with jagged vertical offsets where this improves link routing and label legibility.",
                "specificationLanguageId": "markdown",
                "tests": "{\"cases\":[]}",
                "testsLanguageId": "json",
                "aiInstructions": "",
                "aiInstructionsLanguageId": "markdown"
            },
            "binaryContent": null,
            "technology": {
                "languageId": "",
                "technologyId": "",
                "compilerId": "",
