        {
            "id": "node_35c3ac18-f009-4b8b-af87-4ab749c06e07",
            "name": "loadOrCreateGenericSpecialization",
            "kind": "Processor",
            "parentId": "node_552800d5-bddc-4387-b6b3-fe34a4e00200",
            "children": [],
            "incomingLinks": [
                "link_efeba705-0bfa-4761-a219-82220c5cf6ef",
                "link_14c67e67-f934-4955-a233-6c7f54673115",
                "link_8cd702d6-abc1-4bc7-85e2-23c86edd3196"
            ],
            "outgoingLinks": [
                "link_02a6e08e-2f4b-4d98-acea-5a1e3508e104"
            ],
            "layout": {
                "x": 8393.0,
                "y": -1002.0,
                "width": 335.0,
                "height": 108.0,
                "closedWidth": 335.0,
                "closedHeight": 108.0,
                "openWidth": 335.0,
                "openHeight": 108.0,
                "isExpanded": true
            },
            "fileLayoutStrategyId": "none",
            "text": {
                "initialization": "",
                "initializationLanguageId": "",
                "source": "fun loadOrCreateGenericSpecialization(specializationKeys, compileTimeEvaluationService6, specializationRequests2) {\n  val packet1 = pop(\"specializationKeys\")\n  val packet2 = pop(\"specializationRequests2\")\n  val outcome = compileTimeEvaluationService6.invokeLoadOrCreateGenericSpecialization(packet1, packet2)\n  when (outcome) {\n    is Success -> {\n    push(\"specializedAst\", outcome.value)\n    }\n    is Failure -> {\n    return outcome\n    }\n  }\n}",
                "sourceLanguageId": "kotlin",
                "specification": "# loadOrCreateGenericSpecialization\n\n## Functional role\n\nThis entity is a callable processing function in the runCompileTimeExpansion composite. Its name is a verb because it performs the operation; it is not a prototype and does not own the bulk algorithm.\n\n## Technical contract\n\n- Function signature: `loadOrCreateGenericSpecialization(specializationKeys, compileTimeEvaluationService6, specializationRequests2)`.\n- Incoming links are noun-named channels materialized as function arguments: `specializationKeys`, `compileTimeEvaluationService6`, `specializationRequests2`.\n- Data arguments hold packet or object-prototype instances. The function MUST pop each data channel before invoking the library.\n- Library argument: `compileTimeEvaluationService6`, supplied by the `library_compileTimeEvaluation` library suite.\n- The function invokes one coherent library operation `invokeLoadOrCreateGenericSpecialization(...)` and routes its Operation<T,E> result.\n- Success packets are pushed to outgoing noun-named channels: `specializedAst`.\n- Expected failures are routed to the returned failure; failures MUST NOT be hidden.\n- Parsing, resolution, evaluation, lowering, emission, and workspace algorithms belong in the library suite, not in this node.",
                "specificationLanguageId": "markdown",
                "tests": "{\"cases\":[]}",
                "testsLanguageId": "json",
                "aiInstructions": "",
                "aiInstructionsLanguageId": "markdown"
            },
            "binaryContent": null,
