            "text": {
                "initialization": "",
                "initializationLanguageId": "",
                "source": "",
                "sourceLanguageId": "kotlin",
                "specification": "# specializationKeys\n\n## Functional role\n\nThis link is a named data channel. It carries instances of the declared packet prototype from `buildSpecializationKey` to `loadOrCreateGenericSpecialization`. The channel name is a noun because the link holds information or an object instance; processing verbs belong to the endpoint functions.\n\n## Technical contract\n\n- Channel name: `specializationKeys`; it is unique among all channels incident to either endpoint.\n- Source function: `buildSpecializationKey` pushes through source port `specializationKeys`.\n- Target function: `loadOrCreateGenericSpecialization` receives the channel at target port `specializationKeys`.\n- Payload: instances of the declared packet prototype.\n- Transport: in-process.\n- The source pushes packets and the target pops packets; no hidden transformation occurs in the channel.\n- Any adaptation belongs in the explicitly invoked library operation, not in the link.\n- Declared prototype: `SemanticModel`; the link carries instances of this type definition.",
                "specificationLanguageId": "markdown",
                "tests": "{\"cases\":[]}",
                "testsLanguageId": "json",
