                "sourceLanguageId": "kotlin",
                "specification": "# sourceFileService3\n\n## Functional role\n\nThis link is a named service channel. It carries a library service capability from `lib_source_files` to `indexReferences`. The channel name is a noun because the link holds information or an object instance; processing verbs belong to the endpoint functions.\n\n## Technical contract\n\n- Channel name: `sourceFileService3`; it is unique among all channels incident to either endpoint.\n- Source function: `lib_source_files` pushes through source port `service`.\n- Target function: `indexReferences` receives the channel at target port `library`.\n- Payload: a library service capability.\n- Transport: in-process.\n- The target receives the library suite capability as a function argument; the channel carries no algorithmic implementation.\n- Any adaptation belongs in the explicitly invoked library operation, not in the link.",
                "specificationLanguageId": "markdown",
                "tests": "{\"cases\":[]}",
                "testsLanguageId": "json",
                "aiInstructions": "",
                "aiInstructionsLanguageId": "markdown"
