            "fileLayoutStrategyId": "none",
            "text": {
                "initialization": "",
                "initializationLanguageId": "",
                "source": "",
                "sourceLanguageId": "kotlin",
                "specification": "# SemanticModel\n\n## Functional role\n\n`SemanticModel` is an object-instance prototype for structured compiler packets. Instances cross function boundaries through noun-named channels; the prototype contains data and invariants, not behavior.\n\n## Field contract\n\n| Field | Type | Storage | Meaning |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| moduleId | String | value | Module identity for the semantic snapshot. |\n| scopes | Map<ScopeId,Scope> | value | Resolved lexical and module scopes. |\n| symbols | Map<SymbolId,Symbol> | value | Declared symbols and their ownership scopes. |\n| references | List<Reference> | value | Resolved symbol references with source ranges. |\n| resolvedTypes | Map<NodeId,ResolvedType> | value | Types assigned to expressions, declarations, and generated nodes. |\n| sourceOrigins | SourceAndOriginModel | prototype reference | Source and origin snapshot used for diagnostics and navigation. |\n| diagnostics | List<Diagnostic> | prototype reference | Semantic diagnostics associated with this snapshot. |\n| isComplete | Boolean | value | Whether resolution reached a complete stable result. |\n\n## Technical contract\n\n- The qualifier is `object`; each packet is an independently owned instance.\n- Fields with stable identifiers MUST preserve identity across incremental compilation.\n- Source ranges and origin fields MUST remain usable for diagnostics, navigation, and generated-code mapping.\n- Processing nodes may pop and push instances of this prototype, while libraries create, transform, validate, and persist them.\n- Type identifiers use PascalCase; algorithms remain in libraries.",
                "specificationLanguageId": "markdown",
                "tests": "{\"cases\":[]}",
                "testsLanguageId": "json",
                "aiInstructions": "",
                "aiInstructionsLanguageId": "markdown"
            },
