            "text": {
                "initialization": "",
                "initializationLanguageId": "",
                "source": "",
                "sourceLanguageId": "kotlin",
                "specification": "# Child\n\n## Functional role\n\n`Child` is an object-instance prototype representing an item owned by a `Parent` instance.\n\n## Field contract\n\n| Field | Type | Storage | Meaning |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| id | String | value | Stable child identifier. |\n| name | String | value | Human-readable child name. |\n\n## Technical contract\n\n- The qualifier is `object`; this declaration describes instances, not executable behavior.\n- `Child` is referenced by `Parent.children` through its stable Threadwork type ID.\n- Processing nodes route `Child` instances through noun-named channels; libraries construct and validate them.\n- The prototype contains data and invariants, not executable behavior.",
                "specificationLanguageId": "markdown",
                "tests": "{\"cases\":[]}",
                "testsLanguageId": "json",
